==============================================================================
ERGODIC / EQUIDISTRIBUTION ANGLE (quantitative):
The dyadic doubling-orbit of b under x->2x equidistributes. For consec, the
orbit {frac(e x)} is the densest 'multi-scale' net. Measure the WORST-CASE
uncovered: max over x of (#sectors MISSED). Lower worst-miss => higher p0.
==============================================================================
   consec{1..8}                       p0=0.41616  worst-miss=6 sectors @x=1/112
